Required attribution
--------------------
Any use of the data, tables or figures must credit Bodytype.org and link to
https://bodytype.org.

A suitable attribution line is:

  Bodytype.org. "When a centimeter changes the label: boundary sensitivity in
  a body type calculator" (algorithm v2, dataset 1.0).
  https://bodytype.org/research/boundary-sensitivity-body-type-calculator

The attribution must:
- identify Bodytype.org as the source;
- link to https://bodytype.org;
- link to the source page above;
- link to the CC BY 4.0 license; and
- indicate if you changed the data, table or figure.

Scope
-----
This license covers the synthetic grid, summary files, CSV tables and SVG
figures in this delivery package. It does not cover the analysis code, which
is released under the MIT License in the LICENSE file.

The data are a deterministic scan of Bodytype's v2 classification rules on a
synthetic grid. They are not a population sample, not an accuracy study, not
medical data, and contain no user measurements.
